===Entering Puro-Puro===
{{main|Crop circle}}
The minigame is located in [[Puro-Puro]]. To access Puro-Puro, the player can go through the main [[crop circle]] in [[Zanaris]] (located in the middle of a wheat field, east of the [[fairy ring]]). There are also other crop circles that randomly appear in wheat fields around Gielinor. The current location of the migratory crop circle can be found by talking to the [[wandering impling]] who loiters inside the wheat field of Zanaris (players may evade the small talk by selecting the right-click "Check-gates" option).
